# Accepted findings from the misconfiguration scan. Each entry says why.

# Public EKS API endpoint. It is restricted to the caller's own CIDRs, and the
# api_allowed_cidrs variable rejects 0.0.0.0/0. A private-only endpoint would
# need a VPN or bastion, which is out of scope for this reference.
AWS-0040
AVD-AWS-0040

# Unrestricted egress from the node security group. Nodes sit in private
# subnets behind NAT and need outbound access to pull images and reach AWS
# APIs. Pod-level egress is restricted by NetworkPolicy instead.
AWS-0104
AVD-AWS-0104
